    ["Secret Tome's Protection"] = "Защита секретного фолианта",
    ["The Dark Demonic Wolf pulls the spirit body threads of all players and draws them to its side. The spirit body threads of players connected in pairs are disrupted, continuously dealing damage to each other."] = "The Dark Demonic Wolf pulls the Нити духовного тела of all players and draws them to its side. The Нити духовного тела of players connected in pairs are disrupted, continuously dealing damage to each other.",
